    "16457242689a58d7f3": {
      "type": "accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "164572426857089649-1": {
          "type": "tab_content",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where are the products manufactured?",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "text": "<p>All our products are manufactured in our own family-owned factory in China, which we have owned and operated for over 25 years. We are one of the largest titanium outdoor producing facilities in the world, and are a certified ISO:9001-2015 facility.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "164572426857089649-2": {
          "type": "tab_content",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is your return policy?",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "text": "<p>If you are unsatisfied with your product order please contact us immediately at <a href=\"mailto:info@silverantoutdoors.com\">info@silverantoutdoors.com</a>. We offer a 30-day return policy for all products provided proof of receipt in those 30 days. For damage or to repair, based on the lifetime warranty, please contact us to organize sending the product back to us for repair or replace.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "164572426857089649-0": {
          "type": "tab_content",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long is the product warranty?",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "text": "<p>All products are covered by a lifetime warranty, apart from our tent stakes. We base each case individually, depending on the reason for damage and its cause. Costs may be incurred for shipping and repairs should the damage not be caused by issues with the product's integrity.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "164572426857089649-1",
        "164572426857089649-2",
        "164572426857089649-0"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "title": "General Info",
        "description": "",
