    "1645724424d6db0e5a": {
      "type": "accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "164572442464b4aa49-0": {
          "type": "tab_content",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you ship internationally?",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "text": "<p>Yes, we ship worldwide and offer great rates. We ship all our products with leading logistics companies, including FedEx, USPS, DHL, Royal Mail, AusPost, and Hermes, among others.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "164572442464b4aa49-1": {
          "type": "tab_content",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the expected delivery time for an international order?",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "text": "<p>At SilverAnt Outdoors, we strive to deliver all products within 10-12 business days from the date of purchase, depending on geographical location. However, unforeseen circumstances can sometimes cause delays. All orders are shipped with a tracking number to give you peace of mind. Check our <a href=\"https://silverantoutdoors.com/apps/17TRACK\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://silverantoutdoors.com/apps/17TRACK\">Order Tracking Page</a> to check the status of your shipments.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "164572442464b4aa49-2": {
          "type": "tab_content",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I return my order?",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "text": "<p>We always aim for make sure our customers love our products, but if you do need to return an order, we’re happy to help. Just email us directly and we’ll take you through the process.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
