      "settings": {
        "newsletter_heading": "Subscribe To Our Newsletter:",
        "newsletter_description": "<p>Join our outdoor community to receive updates from SilverAnt. From exclusive product promotions to captivating articles, podcasts, and expert product guides, our emails unveil a world of inspiration each month. Plus, for every subscription, we're committed to <em><strong>planting a tree</strong></em> and contributing to a greener planet. Stay in the loop with our latest company updates, trends, and the innovative world of our titanium outdoor products. Don't miss out—subscribe now and be a part of our outdoor community towards a sustainable future!</p>",
